{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：07:31 2026-10-08 HKT<br/>發佈時間：07:31 2026-10-08 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：07:31 2026-10-08 HKT</p><p>美斯在告別戰後，發文剖白心情，坦言已經開始想念為阿根廷披甲，並感謝家人、朋友和隊友等多年的支持和陪伴。C朗亦在帖文下留言，和美斯致敬。阿仙奴則宣布與阿迪達續約4年，據報賴斯亦接近簽下長約。《BBC》的報道指，哥迪奧拿預料將於下周中曼城的主場比賽，現身撐場。</p><img alt=\"C朗向多年宿敵致敬。法新社\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b1c883c659e21d99d788b84296cb1c06/2026-10/AFP__20141118__DV1911314__v2__HighRes__522091113.jpg\"/><img alt=\"美斯感激家人的陪伴和支持。美聯社\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0915b09b666c9684199a93c5cd2f76c1/2026-10/AP26280087422999.jpg\"/><img alt=\"阿迪達與阿仙奴續約至2030年。法新社\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1c34c944b3aa60e52f330a65d705911b/2026-10/AFP__20260910__cippitelli-sscnapol260909_npzqT__v1__HighRes__SscNapoliVArsenalFcUefa.jpg\"/><img alt=\"哥迪奧拿下周預料將到曼城主場觀賽。法新社\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f548c763c95b0a63e23d0c5f3b9c594d/2026-10/AFP__20260524__cosgrove-premierl260524_npPJv__v1__HighRes__ManchesterCityVAstonVilla.jpg\"/><img alt=\"麥湯文尼今季只上陣兩場。法新社\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/682f288635dd9673712f3533e7b9efb1/2026-10/AFP__20260901__maffia-sscnapol260830_np1uj__v1__HighRes__SscNapoliVComo1907SerieAEni.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T23:38:55.135962+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":211,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}